# E2E SFTP fixture data is mutated in place by the hotfix E2E test run
# (uploads, out-of-band conflict edits); it is regenerated fresh by
# test/runE2e.ts before every run and must never be committed.
test/fixtures/sftp-data/
.vscode-test/

# AuditLog's default path (extension.ts) when no gangway.auditLogPath is
# configured in globalState -- falls back to the extension host process's
# own cwd. Real E2E runs (test/runE2e.ts) don't seed that key (unlike the
# unit tests' fakeContext(), which points it at os.tmpdir()), so a real run
# leaves this at the repo root.
/sftp-hotfix-uploads.log
